# CR 700.2 + 601.2c: a Charm mode's SubAbility$ that names its own ValidTgts$
# chooses its own target as the spell is cast. Inscription of Abundance's
# third mode is "DB$ Pump | ValidTgts$ Creature.YouCtrl | SubAbility$ DBFight"
# with "DBFight: DB$ Fight | Defined$ ParentTarget | ValidTgts$
# Creature.YouDontCtrl": the Pump targets Grizzly Bears, the Fight link
# targets Llanowar Elves (CharmEffect.chainAbilities appends the mode with its
# chain; setupTargets walks it). The Bears fight the Elves: the Elves die,
# the Bears keep 1 damage. Were the link handed the mode's target, the Bears
# would fight themselves.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 5 G
tapformana human 6 G
# Kicker {2}{G} declined: one mode (MinCharmNum$/CharmNum$ read Count$Kicked).
queue confirmpaycost false
# Modes offered: DBPutCounter, DBGainLife, DBPump -- the third.
queue modechoice 2
queue targets 1
queue targets 2
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 3
resolvestack
